WEBVTT

00:00:05.694 --> 00:00:11.694
Choose Categories in the side menu.

00:00:16.158 --> 00:00:22.158
Click Add category.

00:00:24.799 --> 00:00:30.799
Type "Demo Study Skills" in the Name box.

00:00:35.986 --> 00:00:41.986
Click Save.

00:00:44.627 --> 00:00:50.627
Click Move Demo Study Skills up.

00:00:54.729 --> 00:01:00.729
Click Rename Demo Study Skills.

00:01:04.710 --> 00:01:10.710
Type " Tips" in the Name box.

00:01:14.449 --> 00:01:20.449
Click Save.

00:01:23.091 --> 00:01:29.091
Click Hide Demo Study Skills Tips.

00:01:33.436 --> 00:01:39.436
Click Delete Demo Study Skills Tips.

00:01:44.020 --> 00:01:50.020
Click Delete category.
